      <description align="center" color="purple" colored="true" height="531" resized="true" width="325" x="13" y="28">ODS_WF_ALERT&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Vaidik Patel&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Generated ods output are read from output table, and corresponding to cause_ids, the wf is generated. The trn eoods table is updated which will keep the record of the workflow generated. Based on few logics will decide if to be updated in the trn eoods table or to create new entry. the triggered workflow will be assigned to respective assignees which will be handled by IBM BPM.</description>
